{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >STEEL ROAD:  is a dynamic combat game. Prepare to face powerful enemies in matches &amp; tournaments using a variety of combat moves, and explore diverse cities, each offering unique challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2694\ufe0f Key Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Dynamic Combat Gameplay: Engage in epic battles that rely on quick reflexes and smart strategy.    </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Amazing Sound Effects: Sound effects that add depth to the experience, making it more exciting and thrilling. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After Professor Black Steel was stopped, he promised \u2014 and agreed with Professor Mansoor and Professor Folath \u2014 to encourage the townspeople to develop their businesses and products. They decided to establish a robot fighting league in every district, where each shop has its own robot. If a robot wins a match, the shop earns points, and the more points it earns, the more promotion it receives in the city. This system was created to motivate everyone to offer the highest quality products in the entire town.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4099070?t=1774914244","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4099070?t=1774914244","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4099070/5c473ab881680e34a55fad1e4d3e64def4da24ba/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774914244","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4099070/5c473ab881680e34a55fad1e4d3e64def4da24ba/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1774914244","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >STEEL ROAD:  is a dynamic combat game. Prepare to face powerful enemies in matches &amp; tournaments using a variety of combat moves, and explore diverse cities, each offering unique challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2694\ufe0f Key Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Dynamic Combat Gameplay: Engage in epic battles that rely on quick reflexes and smart strategy.    </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Amazing Sound Effects: Sound effects that add depth to the experience, making it more exciting and thrilling. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After Professor Black Steel was stopped, he promised \u2014 and agreed with Professor Mansoor and Professor Folath \u2014 to encourage the townspeople to develop their businesses and products. They decided to establish a robot fighting league in every district, where each shop has its own robot. If a robot wins a match, the shop earns points, and the more points it earns, the more promotion it receives in the city. This system was created to motivate everyone to offer the highest quality products in the entire town.</p>","developers":["SAJ GAME ELECTRONIC"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4099070/74c47bc5f6ff7ef3a83c261b82b02ce3719c2bd0/header.jpg?t=1774914244","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4099070/579647256/f3c7271d8f24f199803a0e7e197138f7801dac82/1774913879/dash_av1.mpd?t=1774914241","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4099070/579647256/f3c7271d8f24f199803a0e7e197138f7801dac82/1774913879/dash_h264.mpd?t=1774914241","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4099070/579647256/f3c7271d8f24f199803a0e7e197138f7801dac82/1774913879/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1774914241","id":257311613,"name":"steel road mini world 2nd trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steams